Package: python3-sdl3
Architecture: any
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: Python 3 bindings for SDL3 and SDL3_image
 A hand-written CPython extension that exposes SDL3 (with SDL3_image) as the
 SDL3 module: windows, rendering, surfaces, textures, events, input, audio,
 gamepads, timers and more. Functions and constants drop the SDL_ prefix
 (SDL_RenderPresent becomes Renderer.Present, SDL_EVENT_QUIT becomes
 SDL3.EVENT_QUIT).
